    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d603">

                <pb facs="0631" n="619" sameAs="frus:frus1945v04/pg619"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">860D.01/8–645</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-08-06">August 6, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Soviet Chargé d’Affaires, Mr. Novikov, called on me this afternoon and said
                    that following the understanding at the Potsdam Conference,<anchor n="55"
                        xml:id="d603-f1"/> his Government had decided to resume diplomatic relations
                    with Rumania<anchor n="56" xml:id="d603-f2"/> and Finland<anchor n="57"
                        xml:id="d603-f3"/> and had informed those Governments <pb facs="0632"
                        n="620" xml:id="pg620"/> to that effect yesterday. I thanked Mr. Novikov for
                    giving us this information.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Joseph</hi> C. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d603-f1" n="55" xml:id="d603-f1-content">
                <p>For documentation on the decisions taken at the Potsdam Conference respecting the
                    recognition of former German satellites, see <ref
                        target="frus1945Berlinv02#pg_686">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, The Conference of Berlin
                        (The Potsdam Conference), 1945, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>,
                        pp. 686</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d603-f2" n="56" xml:id="d603-f2-content">
                <p>The announcement by the Soviet Union of the resumption of diplomatic relations
                    with Rumania was made on August 6, 1945.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d603-f3" n="57" xml:id="d603-f3-content">
                <p>In telegram 2994, August 21, 1945, from Moscow, Ambassador Harriman informed the
                    Department that Pavel Dmitriyevich Orlov, the Political Adviser to the Allied
                    Control Commission, had been named the Minister of the Soviet Union to Finland
                    on August 18 (701.6160d/8–2145).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
